			"notes": "Updated for Minecraft 1.21.11\n\n### Changes\n- Renamed the mod to **Rummage**\n- **Find** button in your inventory opens a search menu with every item in the game\n- Press **F9** to open the Find menu and **F10** to clear outlines (rebindable in Controls)\n- Searched items outline the storage blocks that contain them\n- Supports chests, trapped chests, barrels, shulker boxes, and ender chests\n- Outlines stay until you clear them, or clear automatically when you open that container (toggle in Mod Menu)\n- `/find <item>` lists coordinates in chat when cheats are on\n- Mod Menu settings: outline color, outline thickness, Gamer Mode (rainbow outlines) and RGB speed\n\n### Bug fixes\n- Breaking an outlined storage block now removes its outline"
